{"tiddlers":{"$:/themes/huwiki/retro/Styles":{"title":"$:/themes/huwiki/retro/Styles","type":"text/css","tags":"$:/tags/Stylesheet","text":"/* HUWiki Retro v0.1.3
   Klassisk dansk plakatgrafik – ikke et dashboard eller et layout-plugin.
   Alle væsentlige farver kommer fra TiddlyWikis valgte palet.
   Kompatibel med Vanilla og egne tiddler-tilpasninger. */
:root {
  --hu-r-paper: var(--tpc-tiddler-background, #fff4df);
  --hu-r-ink: var(--tpc-foreground, #163846);
  --hu-r-outline: var(--tpc-tiddler-border, #1a4450);
  --hu-r-sun: var(--tpc-highlight-background, #fac349);
  --hu-r-clay: var(--tpc-alert-highlight, #e45538);
  --hu-r-teal: var(--tpc-primary, #166b73);
  --hu-r-rule: var(--tpc-tab-border, #173d47);
}
html body.tc-body {
  font-family: var(--tp-font-family, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Avenir Next', Arial, sans-serif);
  letter-spacing: .005em;
  color: var(--hu-r-ink);
  background-color: var(--tpc-page-background, #f0e0c1);
  background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 90% 5%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--hu-r-sun) 26%, transparent) 0, transparent 24rem);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
.tc-site-title {
  font-family: var(--hu-retro-headings, 'Arial Black', Impact, 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif);
  font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 2.4vw, 2.3rem);
  text-transform: none; letter-spacing: -.065em; line-height: 1.1;
}
.tc-site-subtitle {font-size:.86rem;letter-spacing:.01em;line-height:1.45;max-width:26em;}
.tc-sidebar-header {
  padding: 1.1em 1.1em 1.4em;
  margin-bottom: 1em;
  border: 2px solid var(--hu-r-outline);
  border-top: 9px solid var(--hu-r-clay);
  border-radius: 3px 3px 16px 3px;
  background: var(--hu-r-paper);
  box-shadow: 6px 7px 0 var(--hu-r-outline);
}
.tc-page-controls button {border-radius: 5px;}
.tc-search input {
  box-sizing:border-box;min-height:2.6em;
  border:2px solid var(--hu-r-outline);
  border-radius: 5px 14px 5px 5px;
  padding:.55em .8em;
  background:var(--hu-r-paper);color:var(--hu-r-ink);
}
.tc-search input:focus {outline:3px solid var(--hu-r-sun);outline-offset:2px;}
.tc-sidebar-tabs .tc-tab-buttons {
  padding: 4px; margin-bottom:.7em;
  border:2px solid var(--hu-r-rule);
  border-radius:7px;
  background:var(--tpc-sidebar-tab-background,#efd8a9);
}
.tc-sidebar-tabs .tc-tab-buttons button {
  border-radius:4px!important; font-weight:700;
  font-size:.86em;letter-spacing:.015em;
  padding:.48em .58em;
}
.tc-sidebar-tabs .tc-tab-buttons button.tc-tab-selected {
  background:var(--tpc-sidebar-tab-background-selected,#fff4df)!important;
  box-shadow:2px 3px 0 var(--hu-r-outline);
}
.tc-sidebar-lists {font-size:.93em;line-height:1.48;}
.tc-story-river {padding-bottom:5em;}
.tc-tiddler-frame {
  position:relative;
  border:2px solid var(--hu-r-outline)!important;
  border-radius: 4px var(--hu-retro-corners,21px) 6px 6px!important;
  background:var(--hu-r-paper)!important;
  box-shadow:7px 8px 0 var(--hu-r-outline);
  margin-bottom:2.6em;
  transition:box-shadow .18s ease,transform .18s ease;
}
.tc-tiddler-frame:hover {box-shadow:9px 10px 0 var(--hu-r-outline);}
.tc-tiddler-frame::before {
  content:"";display:var(--hu-retro-stripes,block);height:7px;margin:-0.1em 0 .8em;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(108deg,var(--hu-r-clay) 0 38px,var(--hu-r-sun) 38px 72px,var(--hu-r-teal) 72px 104px,var(--hu-r-outline) 104px 118px);
  border-radius:1px 9px 0 0;pointer-events:none;
}
.tc-titlebar h2.tc-title,.tc-tiddler-title {
  font-family:var(--hu-retro-headings,'Arial Black',Impact,'Trebuchet MS',Arial,sans-serif);
  font-size:clamp(1.3em,2vw,1.75em);
  line-height:1.16;letter-spacing:-.046em;font-weight:900;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
  color:var(--tpc-tiddler-title-foreground, #163846);
}
.tc-titlebar {border-bottom:2px solid var(--hu-r-rule);padding-bottom:.5rem;margin-bottom:.7rem;}
.tc-tiddler-subtitle {font-size:.79em;letter-spacing:.065em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.86;}
.tc-tiddler-body {font-size:1.015em;line-height:var(--tp-body-line-height,1.7);}
.tc-tiddler-body h1,.tc-tiddler-body h2,.tc-tiddler-body h3,.tc-tiddler-body h4 {
  font-family:var(--hu-retro-headings,'Arial Black','Trebuchet MS',Arial,sans-serif);
  font-weight:900;line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-.04em;
}
.tc-tiddler-body h1 {font-size:1.9em}
.tc-tiddler-body h2 {font-size:1.52em}
.tc-tiddler-body h3 {font-size:1.22em}
.tc-tiddler-body blockquote {
  border-left:6px solid var(--hu-r-clay);
  padding:.55em 1.1em;margin:1.15em 0;
  background:var(--tpc-button-background,#ffe6ad);
  border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;
}
.tc-tiddler-body hr {border:0;border-top:3px solid var(--hu-r-rule);}
.tc-tiddler-body table {border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;border:2px solid var(--hu-r-rule);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden}
.tc-tiddler-body th {background:var(--tpc-button-background,#ffe6ad);font-weight:850;}
.tc-tiddler-body pre,.tc-tiddler-body code {border-radius:4px}
.tc-tiddler-controls button,.tc-page-controls button {transition:transform .12s ease,background .12s ease;}
.tc-tiddler-controls button:hover,.tc-page-controls button:hover {background:var(--tpc-button-background,#ffe6ad);transform:translateY(-1px);}
.tc-tiddler-controls button:focus-visible,.tc-page-controls button:focus-visible,
.tc-body a:focus-visible,.tc-body button:focus-visible {outline:3px solid var(--hu-r-clay);outline-offset:2px;}
.tc-tags-wrapper .tc-tag-list-item,.tc-tag-label {border-radius:5px!important;}
.tc-edit-texteditor,.tc-edit-texteditor-body,.tc-modal {border-radius:6px;}
.tc-drop-down,.tc-block-dropdown {border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--hu-r-rule);}
/* The common dashboard remains independent; retro colours give it a new identity. */
.hu-db-hero {
  border:3px solid var(--hu-r-outline)!important;
  border-radius:5px 28px 5px 5px!important;
  background:var(--tpc-button-background,#ffe6ad)!important;
  box-shadow:5px 6px 0 var(--hu-r-outline);
  padding:clamp(1.65rem,3.4vw,2.8rem);
  margin-bottom:2rem;
}
.hu-db-hero::after {
  content:"";display:var(--hu-retro-rainbow,block);opacity:.87;pointer-events:none;
  position:absolute;top:2.0rem;right:-3rem;width:clamp(155px,28%,280px);height:clamp(155px,28vw,280px);
  border:0;border-radius:50%;
  background:repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 55% 65%,var(--hu-r-sun) 0 13px,var(--hu-r-clay) 13px 24px,var(--hu-r-teal) 24px 31px,var(--hu-r-outline) 31px 37px);
  mask-image:linear-gradient(to left,black,black 55%,transparent);
  -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to left,black,black 55%,transparent);
}
.hu-db-hero h2 {
  font-family:'Arial Black',Impact,'Trebuchet MS',sans-serif;
  text-transform:none;letter-spacing:-.062em;
  font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3.15rem);font-weight:900;
  line-height:1.03;position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:78%;
}
.hu-db-kicker {font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--hu-r-clay)!important;}
.hu-db-hero p {position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:65%;color:var(--hu-r-ink)!important;}
.hu-db-actions {position:relative;z-index:2;}
.hu-db-primary,.hu-db-secondary {border-radius:3px!important;font-weight:900!important;letter-spacing:.02em;min-height:43px;}
.hu-db-primary {background:var(--hu-r-outline)!important;color:var(--hu-r-paper)!important;border:2px solid var(--hu-r-outline)!important;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 var(--hu-r-clay)!important;}
.hu-db-secondary {border:2px solid var(--hu-r-outline)!important;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 var(--hu-r-outline)!important;}
.hu-db-sectionhead h3 {font-family:'Arial Black','Trebuchet MS',sans-serif;font-size:1.16rem;letter-spacing:-.034em;}
.hu-db-sectionhead span {font-size:.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;}
.hu-db-card {
  border:2px solid var(--hu-r-outline)!important;
  border-radius:5px 15px 5px 5px!important;
  box-shadow:4px 5px 0 var(--hu-r-outline);
  transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease;
  background:var(--hu-r-paper);
}
.hu-db-card:nth-child(2) {background:var(--tpc-button-background,#ffe6ad);}
.hu-db-card:nth-child(3) {background:var(--tpc-alert-background,#ffdfae);}
.hu-db-card:hover {transform:translate(-1px,-2px);box-shadow:6px 7px 0 var(--hu-r-outline)!important;}
.hu-db-card a,.hu-db-card button.tc-btn-invisible {font-weight:900;}
.hu-db-icon {border:2px solid var(--hu-r-outline);border-radius:50%;background:var(--hu-r-sun);color:var(--hu-r-outline);}
.hu-db-recent a {border:1.5px solid var(--hu-r-outline);border-radius:3px;background:var(--hu-r-paper);}
.hu-db-tags button.tc-tag-label {border:2px solid var(--hu-r-outline)!important;border-radius:4px!important;background:var(--tpc-button-background,#ffe6ad)!important;}
@media(max-width:750px) {
  .tc-sidebar-header{padding:.85em .8em;margin:.5em 0 1em;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 var(--hu-r-outline)}
  .tc-tiddler-frame {margin-bottom:1.5em;border-radius:4px var(--hu-retro-corners,21px) 4px 4px!important;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 var(--hu-r-outline);}
  .tc-tiddler-frame:hover {box-shadow:3px 4px 0 var(--hu-r-outline);}
  .tc-titlebar h2.tc-title {font-size:clamp(1.25rem,5.3vw,1.42rem);line-height:1.22;hyphens:none;}
  .tc-tiddler-body {font-size:1em;}
  .hu-db-hero h2,.hu-db-hero p {max-width:none;}
  .hu-db-hero::after {width:110px;height:110px;opacity:.25;top:1rem;right:-2rem;}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.tc-tiddler-frame,.tc-tiddler-controls button,.tc-page-controls button,.hu-db-card{transition:none!important}}
@media print{html body.tc-body{background:#fff!important;background-image:none!important;color:#111!important}.tc-tiddler-frame{box-shadow:none!important;border:0!important;border-radius:0!important}.tc-tiddler-frame::before{display:none}}

/* iPadOS / WebKit: keep sidebar search focus from magnifying the visual viewport.
   Limit this workaround to touch WebKit and the search input. Do not override
   TiddlyWiki's native sidebar layout, scroll handling or page zoom. */
@supports (-webkit-touch-callout: none) {
  .tc-search input {
    font-size: 16px !important;
    min-height: 30px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .tc-search input:focus {
    outline-offset: -2px;
  }
}
"},"$:/themes/huwiki/retro/Info":{"title":"$:/themes/huwiki/retro/Info","text":"! HUWiki Retro

Bauhaus og 70’er-inspireret tema. Temaet ændrer kun udseendet, ikke wikiens indhold eller startside.

Vælg tema under Kontrolpanel → Design → Tema. Vælg separat palet: HUWiki Retro – Lys eller HUWiki Retro – Mørk.

[[Åbn HUWiki Dashboard|HUWiki Dashboard]] · [[Tilpas tema og palet|$:/ControlPanel]]
